hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1082","We have Bundar, we have Yahya, we have Ubaid Allah, Nafi’ told me, on the authority of Ibn Umar. H Al-Dawrqi and Al-Hasan Al-Zafarani bin Muhammad narrated to us, saying: Muhammad bin Ubaid narrated to us, Ubaid Allah narrated to us, H and Yahya bin A wise man, Hammad bin Masada told us, on the authority of Ubayd Allah, on the authority of Nafi’, on the authority of Ibn Umar, on the authority of the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, who said: “Make Your last prayer at night is Witr.”"
